crate-digger (EPL-2.0)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

rb2engine vendors a Python parser generated from the Kaitai Struct
definition `rekordbox_pdb.ksy` originally published by the crate-digger
project (Deep Symmetry, LLC and contributors).

  Project: https://github.com/Deep-Symmetry/crate-digger
  License: Eclipse Public License 2.0 (EPL-2.0)

The generated module lives under `src/rb2engine/reader/_vendor/` together
with a copy of the EPL-2.0 license text. That file is subject to EPL-2.0
only; EPL-2.0 is file-scoped and does not relicense the rest of rb2engine
(MIT). When regenerating the parser:

  kaitai-struct-compiler -t python rekordbox_pdb.ksy

Do not copy other crate-digger source into this tree.

