libdjinterop (LGPL-3.0) — documentation only
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

libdjinterop (https://github.com/xsco/libdjinterop) is used solely as a
reference for the Engine DJ SQLite schema and PerformanceData blob layouts.

  License: GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0)

No libdjinterop source code, headers, object code, or linked binary is
included in, generated into, or linked against rb2engine. Schema DDL
committed under `src/rb2engine/writer/ddl/` is captured from Engine DJ's
own output, not copied from libdjinterop.
